        "node_id": "n_4_3205a6",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the greedy approach by prioritizing the distribution of cards based on the joy levels rather than just the frequency of the favorite numbers. This means giving higher priority to cards that can maximize the joy level for more players.",
