        "node_id": "n_7_dc5fc8",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the greedy approach by considering the distribution of cards to maximize the total joy level. Instead of assigning the highest joy levels to each player individually, consider how to distribute the cards globally to maximize the sum of joy levels across all players.",
