        "node_id": "n_8_ccd15f",
        "thought_text": "Implement a dynamic programming approach to solve this problem. Define a state as the current set of players and the remaining cards. Use this state to calculate the maximum total joy level by exploring all possible ways to distribute the remaining cards to the remaining players.",
